# Story page: keg
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Powder Keg
---
The next island ticked. Not like a clock. Like a decision.

Bombs lay about in the Powder Keg as casually as apples, and went off rather less casually. {name} discovered that rocks, which had never moved for anyone, moved quite quickly for a bomb.

At the heart of a crater spun a little star, every colour at once. With it, {name} went through rocks the way a rumour goes through a village.
